        -:  230:    /**
        -:  231:     * Initialize the #LIB_SYMBOL reference for each #SCH_SYMBOL found in this schematic
        -:  232:     * from the project #SYMBOL_LIB_TABLE.
        -:  233:     *
        -:  234:     * Symbol library links are set using the symbol library table and will fall back to
        -:  235:     * the cache only if the cache is loaded.  The cache should only be loaded when opening
        -:  236:     * legacy schematic files.
        -:  237:     *
        -:  238:     * @note This should only be called when the user specifically requests all library symbol
        -:  239:     *       links to be updated or when the legacy schematic is opened for the last time.  All
        -:  240:     *       subsequent schematic loads with the new s-expression will contain the library
        -:  241:     *       symbols and should call #UpdateLocalLibSymbolLinks.
        -:  242:     *
