        -:  328:    /**
        -:  329:     * Test if a junction is required for the items at \a aPosition on the screen.  Note that
        -:  330:     * this could be either an implied junction (bus entry) or an explicit junction (dot).
        -:  331:     *
        -:  332:     * A junction is required at \a aPosition if one of the following criteria is satisfied:
        -:  333:     *  - One wire midpoint and one or more wire endpoints.
        -:  334:     *  - Three or more wire endpoints.
        -:  335:     *  - One wire midpoint and a symbol pin.
        -:  336:     *  - Two or more wire endpoints and a symbol pin.
        -:  337:     *  - One bus midpoint or endpoint and a bus entry.
        -:  338:     *
        -:  339:     * @param[in] aPosition The position to test.
        -:  340:     * @return True if a junction is required at \a aPosition.
